vt=[];vte=[];
vt[vt.length]=`<div id="text_86" class="textshirt mergershirt" style="top: 42px; left: 785px; font-size: 26px;">&nbsp;</div>`;
vt[vt.length]=`<div id="text_83" class="textshirt mergershirt" style="width: 335px; white-space: normal; top: 44px; left: 407px; height: 360px;">Er hatte sich diesen Moment oft vorgestellt. Er war nicht ganz so, wie er ihn sich ausgemalt hatte. Er war besser. Nicht, weil das Meer perfekt gewesen wäre. Das war es nicht. <br> In der Nähe lachten Menschen. Ein Kind weinte. Jemand machte zu viele Fotos. Ein Kellner ließ ein Glas fallen. Der Wind war stärker, als er erwartet hatte. Es war echt. <br>Er ging ins Wasser. Hinter ihm lief die Welt ohne ihn weiter. Menschen brauchten Dinge. Menschen verloren Dinge. Menschen bauten Dinge. Menschen machten sich Sorgen. Menschen hatten Erfolg. Menschen scheiterten. Die Software lief. Der Vertrag war unterzeichnet. Die Zukunft wartete. Doch all das war hier nicht. <br>Hier war das Wasser. Hier war die Sonne. Hier war der Sand unter seinen Füßen. Dann ging er weiter.</div>`;
vt[vt.length]=`<div id="text_84" class="textshirt mergershirt" style="width: 335px; white-space: normal; top: 46px; left: 786px; height: 360px;"></div>`;

vte[vte.length]=`<div id="text_86" class="textshirt mergershirt`+transws+`" style="top: 42px; left: 785px; font-size: 26px;">&nbsp;</div>`;
vte[vte.length]=`<div id="text_83" class="textshirt mergershirt`+transws+`" style="width: 335px; white-space: normal; top: 44px; left: 407px; height: 360px;">He had imagined this moment many times. It was not quite the same as he had imagined. It was better. Not because the sea was perfect. It wasn't. <br> There were people laughing nearby. A child was crying. Someone was taking too many photographs. A waiter dropped a glass. The wind was stronger than he expected. It was real. <br>He walked into the water. Behind him, the world continued without him. People needed things. People lost things. People built things. People worried. People succeeded. People failed. The software was running. The contract was signed. The future was waiting. But none of it was here. <br>Here was the water. Here was the sun. Here was the sand beneath his feet. Then he kept walking.</div>`;
vte[vte.length]=`<div id="text_84" class="textshirt mergershirt`+transws+`" style="width: 335px; white-space: normal; top: 46px; left: 786px; height: 360px;"></div>`;
